<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Ideal Rugs — Stock feed sync</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #111;
      --muted: #666;
      --faint: #999;
      --line: #ddd;
      --bg: #fff;
      --soft: #f7f7f7;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font: 16px/1.65 Georgia, "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 40rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 3rem 1.25rem 4rem;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    }
    .meta {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    }
    h2 {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 1.75rem 0 0.65rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    p { margin: 0 0 0.9rem; }
    ul { margin: 0 0 1rem; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
    li { margin: 0.3rem 0; }
    strong { font-weight: 700; }
    .callout {
      border-left: 3px solid #bbb;
      padding: 0.1rem 0 0.1rem 0.85rem;
      margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 0.65rem;
      margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    .stat {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--soft);
      padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;
    }
    .stat .n {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .stat .l {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 0.1rem;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      margin: 0.4rem 0 1rem;
    }
    th, td {
      text-align: left;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.35rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    th {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      font-weight: 550;
    }
    td.num, th.num {
      text-align: right;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 2.25rem;
      padding-top: 0.9rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--faint);
    }
    a { color: var(--ink); }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Stock feed sync is live</h1>
    <p class="meta">Ideal Rugs · 9 September 2026</p>

    <p>
      The storefront now follows the Dropbox stock sheet:
      only SKUs in the feed with stock are shown. Zero stock is hidden.
      When stock returns on the next sync, those products show again.
    </p>

    <div class="callout">
      <strong>qty &gt; 0</strong> → show ·
      <strong>qty = 0</strong> or not in feed → hide ·
      re-run ~every 8 hours to refresh
    </div>

    <h2>This run</h2>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n">77</div>
        <div class="l">Hidden (qty 0)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n">2,091</div>
        <div class="l">Inventory synced</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n">0</div>
        <div class="l">Failures</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Feed</th>
          <th class="num">Count</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>SKUs in sheet</td><td class="num">2,711</td></tr>
        <tr><td>With stock (qty &gt; 0)</td><td class="num">1,992</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Zero stock</td><td class="num">719</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Going forward</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Replace / refresh the CSV from Dropbox</li>
      <li>Run the sync script (with inventory)</li>
      <li>Products back in stock automatically go live again</li>
    </ul>

    <footer>
      Ideal Rugs · Techable ·
      <a href="https://idealrugs.com.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">idealrugs.com.au</a>
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
